<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Solchem year share dips, says in talks.</title>
<headline>Solchem year share dips, says in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, (cts)		6.6	   vs 10.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 nil	   vs 2.8</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   2.74	  vs 4.19</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   4.13	  vs 6.41</p>
<p>    Tax			 1.43	  vs 2.27</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   0.85	  vs 1.13</p>
<p>    Turnover		  98.15	 vs 82.26</p>
<p>Full name: Solchem Investment Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The firm said fierce competition and currency fluctuations hit its profit margins.</p>
<p>The firm also added that it was in talks that may have an impact on the value of the company's shares.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
